#### 9. Assertion Roulette *(Extended catalog — testsmells.org)*

**Test:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (lines 84–86)
**Risk:** Three `Assert.AreEqual` calls with no message parameter. When one fails, the MSTest output shows an expected/actual mismatch with no label — you must read code to know which value was wrong.

```csharp
